"3992",""
"3993",""
"3994",""
"3995","""The most pleasant smell on earth is found in India, where Prophet Adam, peace be upon him, descended. Its trees are made of the fragrance of paradise."" This is an authentic Hadith according to the conditions of Muslim, and Al-Dhahabi did not mention anything about it in his summary."
"3996",""
"3997",""
